        "inboundEventBatching": "Inbound events are not batched by this service and never were — the key configured a Kafka producer this platform does not have, and no code read it. Remove it; there is no replacement setting.",
        "maxReadingsPerMessage": "The readings one event may carry are now a fixed platform limit of 256, the same on every transport, and no longer configurable — a value above 256 is no longer honoured, and neither is a value below it. Remove the key. A device that sends more than 256 readings in one message is refused and counted on total_msg_too_many_readings; it must split them across messages."
